  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Thinly slice the zucchini lengthwise (see Kitchen hack). Cut the tomato into 1cm-thick wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2604298/photos/large/64963_1-d3ea5a323b38792599a71c8f22bd3d43.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake veggies: Put the zucchini and tomato in a bowl. Add ½ tsp dried oregano and 2 tsp olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to combine. Put on one side of the lined tray and bake for 12 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2604299/photos/large/64963_2-6f365ccda5929c6d16ea24676859866a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm rolls: Cut a slit lengthwise down the middle of the rolls. Add to the other side of the tray with the veggies and bake for a further 8-10 mins until the veggies are tender and the rolls are warmed through and crusty.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2604300/photos/large/64963_3-8c2f5f1a6ca51998f139e8f8fefee145.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dress feta and leaves: Put ½ tsp oregano, 1½ tbs olive oil and 1 tsp honey in a large bowl. Season with salt and pepper and whisk to combine. Add the salad leaves, crumble over the feta and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2604301/photos/large/64963_4-69ad44f8af560b10b84fa76dc2903577.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Spread the rolls with the red pesto, then fill with the baked veggies and salad. Toss any remaining veggies and remaining salad together and serve with the subs. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2604302/photos/large/64963_5-2ea672e08025a35aa5ffd2474341f00f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen hack: Use a mandoline or vegetable peeler for super-thin zucchini slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2604303/photos/large/64963_6-16e87ed05d390047a6233e5eb8fca836.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
